# The same trigger as damage-history-command-the-stage-returns-after-
# noncombat-damage, but the only damage the ai took in turn 1 was combat
# damage from an unblocked Grizzly Bears, so wasDealtNonCombatDamageLastTurn
# is false at turn 2's upkeep and Command the Stage stays in the graveyard.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks none
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
advance 6
passpriority
